  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="StNp5.10" class="h1">5:10  Kappa’s Question</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>For one stranded in the middle of the lake,</p>
              <p>in the flood of great danger—birth—</p>
              <p>overwhelmed with aging &amp; death:</p>
              <p class="v1">Tell me the island, dear sir,</p>
              <p class="v1">and show me the island</p>
              <p class="v1">so that this may not happen again.</p>
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p class="vspk">The Buddha:</p>
                <p>For one stranded in the middle of the lake,</p>
                <p>in the flood of great danger—birth—</p>
                <p>overwhelmed with aging &amp; death,</p>
                <p class="v1">Kappa, I will tell you the island.<span class="fn"><a href="#stnp_note5.10.01">1</a></span><!--end fn cite--></p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Having nothing, free</p>
                <p>of clinging:</p>
                <p class="v1">That is the island,</p>
                <p class="v1">there is no other.</p>
                <p>That’s unbinding, I tell you,</p>
                <p>the total ending of aging &amp; death.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Those knowing this, mindful,</p>
                <p class="v3">fully unbound</p>
                <p class="v3">in the here-&amp;-now,</p>
                <p class="v1">don’t serve as Māra’s servants,</p>
                <p class="v1">don’t come under Māra’s sway.<span class="fn"><a href="#stnp_note5.10.02">2</a></span><!--end fn cite--></p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="suttaCite">vv. 1092–1095</p><!--end suttaCite-->
            <div class="note">
              <p class="notetitle">Notes</p><!--end notetitle-->
              <p id="stnp_note5.10.01">1. On the Dhamma as an island, see <a href="../../DN/DN16.html">DN 16</a>.</p>
              <p id="stnp_note5.10.02">2. On Māra’s sway, see <a href="../../SN/SN4_19.html">SN 4:19</a>, <a href="../../SN/SN35_115.html">SN 35:115</a>, <a href="../../SN/SN35_189.html">SN 35:189</a>, and <a href="../../SN/SN35_199.html">SN 35:199</a>.</p>
            </div><!--end note-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
